    Bug 1926711 - Account Hub Density Awareness - Config Found Option Padding. r=aleca

    **How To Test**
    - Get to the config options step of account hub
    - The padding around a config option title and text should change based on compact or normal density
    - There are no changes for relaxed density

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D240628

diff --git a/mail/themes/shared/mail/accountHubForms.css b/mail/themes/shared/mail/accountHubForms.css
index ab0b1299cd1..1dcffba0749 100644
--- a/mail/themes/shared/mail/accountHubForms.css
+++ b/mail/themes/shared/mail/accountHubForms.css
@@ -551,12 +551,13 @@ div:has(legend) {
       display: flex;
       align-items: center;
       flex-wrap: wrap;
-      padding-block: 8px 2px;
-      padding-inline: 8px;
+      padding-block: var(--hub-config-option-padding-block) 2px;
+      padding-inline: var(--hub-config-option-padding-inline);
       font-weight: bold;

       & .config-title-text {
         flex: 1;
+        line-height: 1;
       }

       & input[type="radio"] {
@@ -588,8 +589,8 @@ div:has(legend) {
     & .config-text {
       color: var(--color-text-base);
       font-weight: 400;
-      padding-block: 2px 6px;
-      padding-inline: 9px;
+      padding-block: 2px var(--hub-config-option-padding-block);
+      padding-inline: var(--hub-config-option-padding-inline);
       font-size: 1.1rem;
     }

@@ -600,13 +601,13 @@ div:has(legend) {
       & .config-title {
         background-color: var(--color-primary-default);
         color: var(--color-neutral-base);
-        padding-block: 6px;
+        padding-block: var(--hub-config-option-padding-block);
       }

       & .config-text {
         color: light-dark(#15427c, var(--color-text-base));
         background-color: var(--color-neutral-base);
-        padding-block: 6px;
+        padding-block: var(--hub-config-option-padding-block);
       }

       & .recommended {
